          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}3r^2-6r-24&=3(r^2-2r-8)\\\\3r^2-6r-24&=3(r^2+2r-4r-8)\\\\3r^2-6r-24&=3\\bigl(r(r+2)-4(r+2)\\bigr)\\\\3r^2-6r-24&=3(r-4)(r+2)\\end{align*}$$",
